superv (0.0.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release as .deb package.
  * Clipboard history with text, image, and file URI support.
  * Super+V toggle popup with search and pin functionality.
  * Library window for browsing all items.
  * Autostart support via .desktop file.

